    "summary": "ac1 and ac3 run against the real threaded daemon over its socket (s4-acceptance.test.ts with a shared spawn/socket helper). ac2 runs with real workers but not over the socket: the socket cannot target the admin, indexing or summary worker (every test.* method is session-class), so admin, code-indexing and document-summary failures are checked in the supervisor harness (router and indexing workers now given the board) and session and shared-state failures in the session-failure harness. A mutation building the runtime at boot fails ac1.",
